  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "K+uqmIpwXdqSDxNOnQavFp5iUh4=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-16T20:32:33.185Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "## Claim\n\nModel each skill invocation as an attributable transformation: an action against a document, dispatched by an attributed actor, executed by a deterministic reducer, and recorded in an append-only operation log.\n\n## Implications\n\n- State derives only from replaying the log\n- Every byte in the final state traces to an operation \u2192 skill \u2192 actor\n- The artifact and the provenance record are the same structure\n\n## Contrast\n\nTool-call traces that live *beside* the artifact force post-hoc reconciliation. Unifying them (\"the artifact is the log\") removes that gap.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-16T20:32:33.185Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-16T20:32:33.185Z"
    }
  },
